    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Dollar figures are nominal (not inflation-adjusted) ACS five-year averages, not exact counts. Rent-burden shares exclude renter households whose burden the Census could not compute.",
    "Regional Price Parities are metro-level and revise from year to year; the Flint metro series moved several points between recent years, so treat small differences as noise.",
    "This product uses the Census Bureau Data API but is not endorsed or certified by the Census Bureau."
  ]
